---
description: Ember rules for every agent run in this repo
alwaysApply: true
---

- Start from `AGENTS.md`, then `SPEC.md`, `spec/00_contracts.md` and only the spec section named in your task. `docs/build_process.md` has the task queue and prompts.
- Never change a contract (`engine/ember/contracts.py`, `web/src/contracts.ts`, hub tables or reducers) unless the task says so. Stop and report instead.
- Don't change the look or direction of Linda's UI (`web/`, `design/command-dashboard-mockup/`) unless Linda asked for it.
- Build against the fixture first. No future data. Never fabricate data, imagery or citations.
- Run the acceptance tests named in the task and paste the output. End with the 5-line summary from `AGENTS.md`.
